From 82bd14536aa9f947c17b690865ba8e8e9462aefa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 16:26:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: enforce tier entitlements + build Plus weather/radar &
 unbranded share
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Turn the pricing tiers into real entitlements (until now every personal
feature was free, so $15/$29 unlocked nothing).

Entitlement layer (migration 034):
- user_plan() / user_has_paid_plan() / user_has_plus() — Org folds in as >= Plus
- share_branding() for the public share page

Free vs paid (lightly capped):
- Free keeps trip stories + last 30 days of ride history
- $15 Individual: unlimited history + privacy zones (RLS-gated insert + UI upsell)
- $29 Plus: weather/radar overlay, animated radar timelapse, unbranded share page

Plus builds:
- Radar timelapse via RainViewer (new proxied /api/weather/radar-frames + tiles),
  play/pause + scrubber transport on the map; weather gated to Plus/Org viewers
- Unbranded share + story pages (owner name replaces Waypoint wordmark/CTA)

Fix: share route masked privacy zones with wrong columns (lat/lng/radius_m) so
masking silently did nothing — corrected to center_lat/center_lng/radius_miles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xfza8skNnBXBJCUoYq9sw9
